abstract: >-
  The I·V·O Lens Prompt v4.1 is a domain-independent instrument for structural
  analysis using O (Structured Possibility), V (Instantiated Relation), and I
  (Situated Selectivity) as functional assignments within an explicitly stated
  scope. Version 4.1 retains the frozen v4.0 operator semantics and adds
  epistemic safeguards for evidence provenance, claim status, observation-to-
  mechanism separation, negative claims, hypothesized mechanisms, evidential
  dependencies, causal status, synthesis, intervention, and reliability.
keywords:
